    "Cook and helper copies include selected food labels, amounts, purposes and actions. They leave out native financial and private record data.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cook and helper copies include selected food labels, amounts, purposes and actions. They leave out native financial and private record data."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las copias para quien cocina o ayuda incluyen nombres de alimentos, cantidades, fines y acciones seleccionados. Excluyen los datos financieros y privados de los registros originales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current and newer work stays in place. Different revisions become separate copies; identical imports reopen the saved copy. A conflicting digest or erased identity blocks this batch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current and newer work stays in place. Different revisions become separate copies; identical imports reopen the saved copy. A conflicting digest or erased identity blocks this batch."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El trabajo actual y más reciente se conserva. Las revisiones distintas se guardan por separado; las importaciones idénticas abren la copia guardada. Un contenido contradictorio o una identidad eliminada bloquea este lote."
          }
        }
      }
    },
